{#- A PAGE MADE OF ITS SECTIONS (src/_data/pageSections.json, Website › Site
    Creator › Pages): each one drawn by its kind's own template in this
    folder, in the order the page lists them. The same templates draw the
    console's live preview (admin-sections.js), so the two cannot differ. -#}
{%- for sec in pageSections.pages[pageTitle] %}
{% include "sections/" ~ sec.kind ~ ".njk" %}
{%- endfor %}
